    <mxCell id="logical-hc2" value="Zones · VLANs · subnets · gateways. Every VLAN lives in one zone. Inside VLANs route on the firewall; the guest and event VLANs route on the guest gateway, whose outside leg is a firewall port." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;spacing=2;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="logical-L0">
