    <mxCell id="physical-L8" value="Notes" style="" parent="0" />
    <mxCell id="physical-hc282" value="&lt;b&gt;End devices&lt;/b&gt; · one card per kind of device on each stack; the build counts the rest on it (×N). APs trunk VLANs 11, 61, 100 (native 99); floor 1 APs add 22 (AB-PAY) and 110–118 (events). Terminals on 20, POS on 21, encoders and lock gateways on 63, plant on 70 and 72, cameras on 80. Room TVs, phones and the thermostats' mesh are not network devices here: the switch port or the gateway carries the zone." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#F7FAFD;strokeColor=#E8EEF6;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="physical-L8">
     <mxGeometry x="1680" y="1056" width="1150" height="96" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>
